<title>ESTONIA: MOST STOCKS MOVE HIGHER AFTER SLIGHT DIP.</title>
<headline>MOST STOCKS MOVE HIGHER AFTER SLIGHT DIP.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Total trade on the Estonian bourse at 0845 GMT was 31.8</p>
<p>million kroons.</p>
<p>* Hansapank was the most active stock on</p>
<p>145.50/146.00 kroons versus 143.50 kroons in trade of 10</p>
<p>million kroons of shares.</p>
<p>* Dealers said the morning trade was slow with prices mixed</p>
<p>on opening after yesterday's slight drop with an upwards</p>
<p>correction taking most stocks higher.</p>
</text>
